2. What is the probability of all student's birthday are different? 

:::{.hide}
$$
 =0.59
$$
:::

## {.smaller}
3. What is the probability that at least two people share the same birthday in the classroom with size of 20 ?

:::{.hide}
$$
1-\frac{\binom{365}{20}\times 20!}{365^{20}} =\frac{P^{365}_{20}}{365^{20}}=0.41
$$
:::

